        path: ''
        startLine: 28465
      summary: "\nAdds/removes an amount of a faction&apos;s resource. If the resource type capacity is a limited based capacity resource and there is a rest amount that can not be added due to reaching maximum capacity, it will not be reported by this method.\n"
      example: []
      syntax:
